## 6. App 页面层规范

### 6.1 纯视图页面（项目核心模式）

页面文件只负责渲染，**不包含任何业务逻辑**。数据和逻辑全部由聚合 Hook 提供。

```typescript
// ✅ 正确（dashboard 实际代码 app/buser/dashboard/page.tsx）
'use client';
import { Spin } from 'antd';
import UserGreeting from '@/components/buser/dashboard/UserGreeting';
import StatsCards from '@/components/buser/dashboard/StatsCards';
import EmployeeList from '@/components/buser/dashboard/EmployeeList';
import PublishedPositions from '@/components/buser/dashboard/PublishedPositions';
import { useDashboardPage } from '@/hooks/buser/dashboard';

export default function DashboardPage() {
  const {
    initialLoading, jobListLoading, workbenchData,
    bUserList, jobPosiList, positionCards, departmentOptions,
    handlers, searchState, searchHandlers,
  } = useDashboardPage();

  if (initialLoading) {
    return (
      <div className="flex h-64 w-full items-center justify-center">
        <Spin size="large" />
      </div>
    );
  }

  return (
    <div className="w-full p-8">
      <UserGreeting offerCount={workbenchData?.offerNum ?? 0} />
      <StatsCards stats={workbenchData} />
      <EmployeeList bUserList={bUserList} jobPosiList={jobPosiList} />
      <PublishedPositions
        positions={positionCards}
        departments={departmentOptions}
        loading={jobListLoading}
        pagination={searchState.pagination}
        {...searchState}
        {...searchHandlers}
        {...handlers}
      />
    </div>
  );
}
```

```typescript
// ✅ 正确（messages 实际代码 app/buser/messages/page.tsx）
'use client';
import { Spin, Pagination } from 'antd';
import MessagesHeader from '@/components/buser/messages/MessagesHeader';
import MessageList from '@/components/buser/messages/MessageList';
import { useMessagesPage } from '@/hooks/buser/messages';

export default function MessagesPage() {
  const { loading, messages, counts, paginationState, paginationHandlers, handlers } = useMessagesPage();
  const { activeTab, pagination } = paginationState;
  const { onTabChange, onPageChange } = paginationHandlers;

  return (
    <div className="w-full pl-8">
      <MessagesHeader activeTab={activeTab} counts={counts} onTabChange={onTabChange} />
      <div className="mt-6 pr-8">
        <Spin spinning={loading}>
          <MessageList
            messages={messages}
            activeTab={activeTab}
            onMarkRead={handlers.onMarkRead}
            onDelete={handlers.onDelete}
            onReport={handlers.onReport}
            onContinue={handlers.onContinue}
          />
        </Spin>
        {pagination.total > 0 && (
          <Pagination
            current={pagination.current}
            pageSize={pagination.size}
            total={pagination.total}
            onChange={onPageChange}
          />
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 6.2 页面层禁止事项

| 禁止              | 正确做法                  | 说明                                     |
| ----------------- | ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| 直接调用 Service  | 通过聚合 Hook             | `useDashboardPage()`                     |
| 定义 handler 函数 | 从 Hook 解构 handlers     | `const { handlers } = useMessagesPage()` |
| 管理 state        | 由 Hook 内部管理          | —                                        |
| 数据转换          | 由 Mappers 在 Hook 中处理 | —                                        |
| 直接用 `useSWR`   | 封装在聚合 Hook 中        | —                                        |

### 6.3 加载状态处理

```typescript
